OL,3,GNEWSADry summer puts horse racing
OL,4,Aseason under threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrainer Paul Nicholls, who is based in
OL,7,FDitcheat, Shepton Mallet, said: "It's
OL,8,Fone of the driest summers I've ever
OL,9,Fknown," which is preventing some horses
OL,10,Ffrom running.
OL,12,F"We've had to water pretty much every
OL,13,Fday throughout the summer," said Jeremy
OL,14,FMartin from Salisbury Racecourse.
